ui-verification/
# `admin/` is deliberately NOT listed. It has its own Vercel project whose Root
# Directory is `admin`, and a repository-root .vercelignore can be applied to
# the upload before Vercel descends into that directory — which strips the
# admin app out of its own deployment and fails with "Root Directory does not
# exist". The site's Vite build never reads admin/ anyway, so ignoring it here
# buys nothing but that failure mode.
